Bochner corollary (the classic): ∫ (Δ_g u)² dvol = ... hmm, the Bochner chain identity: -∫ ⟨∇u, ∇Δu⟩ dvol... Actually the classical: ∫ u Δ²u = ∫ (Δu)² via v = Δu: ∫ u Δ(Δu) dvol = -∫ ⟨∇u, ∇Δu⟩ dvol. That's the corollary. Another corollary: with v = u: ∫ u Δu dvol = -∫ |∇u|² dvol (Dirichlet energy).

